One thing you should keep in mind, advancing from skilled to expert
with a weapon is very expensive (in terms of enhancement slots).  An
XP:14 character (quest-eligible) has 13 enhancement slots available.
Taking #twoweapon from unskilled to expert requires 6.  Getting any
weapon from basic to expert requires 5.

It's a good idea to consider your long-term strategy before advancing
something past skilled.

